  "title": "Neogen to Release Third-Quarter Fiscal Year 2026 Financial Results on April 9, 2026",
  "summary": "Neogen® Corporation (NASDAQ: NEOG) will issue its third-quarter earnings release before the opening of the market on Thursday, April 9, 2026. Executives from the company will host a webcast and conference call later that morning, beginning at 8:00 a.m. Eastern time. During the call, Neogen management will provide a financial overview and business update of the company’s performance for the third-quarter of fiscal year 2026. The conference call can be accessed by dialing: Toll-Free - North",
